                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played this game during its bug testing phase at the Salt lake comic con. I got to meet a bunch of the dev team, I an spent probably my whole time at the con at their booth playing through the game. I still come back to all the time, and i've even had to buy it on my second account. Enjoyable gameplay, especially if you love the older platformers like super meat boy. Great sound track that makes it such a vibe, and very straight foward mechanics that are easy to understand, and take practice to master.",
